<title>Philippines: RESEARCH ALERT - Davao Union a long-term buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Davao Union a long-term buy.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stock brokerage BPI Securities rated Davao Union Cement Corp (DUCC) a long-term buy saying the firm was expected to make hefty profits next year amid rising demand for cement.</p>
<p>&quot;We project that sales will continue to be higher due to increasing prices and continued strong demand for cement,&quot; BPI Securities said in a research paper on Thursday.</p>
</text>
